## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical DNS- and LB-related troubleshooting that intermediate engineers confront in global deployments. It emphasizes data collection, reproducibility, and concrete mitigations rather than theory.

## Key Concepts
- DNS TTL and resolver caching
- Geolocation-based routing rules
- Regional load balancer health checks and failover
- Traceroute/tracepath, dig +trace, and MTR for path visibility

